---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="What can this machine analyze? | rea.run"
  description="Capability matrix for native, JS, Android/JADX, firmware, and browser analysis hosts."
  path="/faq/what-can-i-analyze/"
>
  <article class="prose-page mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14">
    <p class="text-sm"><a class="quiet-link" href="/faq/">← FAQ hub</a></p>

    <p class="badge badge-accent mt-4">FAQ · P0</p>
    <h1 class="display mt-4 text-4xl text-[var(--color-ink)]">What can this machine analyze?</h1>
    <p class="lede mt-4 !max-w-none">A host-oriented capability sketch — not a promise that every provider is installed.</p>
    <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-6">
      <table class="compare-table">
        <thead><tr><th>Surface</th><th>Typical engine</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Native binaries</td><td>Ghidra / Hopper / IDA (BYO)</td><td>OS + arch gates; Windows Ghidra is a specific P0 story</td></tr>
          <tr><td>JavaScript / Electron</td><td>REA static JS graph</td><td>No native engine required; large ASAR has its own FAQ</td></tr>
          <tr><td>.NET</td><td>Managed / native paths per docs</td><td>NativeAOT may fall through to native providers</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Android</td><td>JADX (BYO) + Java</td><td>Often smoother on Linux/macOS; Windows users hit “not available here” prompts</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Firmware / packs</td><td>Optional unpackers (BYO)</td><td>Separate prerequisites; do not invent tool installs</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Browser / pages</td><td>Local Chrome-family + REA browser tools</td><td>May need <code>REA_BROWSER_EXECUTABLE</code>; profile isolation matters</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>Ask <code>doctor</code> for the providers you care about. A missing Android/JADX path on Windows is frequently an environment limitation, not a broken npm install.</p>

    <footer class="mt-12 border-t border-[var(--color-line)] pt-6 text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)] not-prose">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Sources</p>
      <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-xs">
          <li><a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/issues/1262" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Issue #1262 — Android/JADX on Windows host</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/blob/main/docs/android-analysis.md" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Upstream android analysis docs</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/morluto/rea/blob/main/README.md" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">REA README</a></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="mt-4"><a class="quiet-link" href="/compliance/">Compliance</a></p>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
